After reading someone's post on the subject of fast ascensions a while
ago I was inspired to try and see how quickly I could win a game of
Nethack.
After many failed attempts with a Valkyrie, I decided to try playing
an Archaeologist, since starting with a pick-axe enables easy robbing
of shops. Since you're in a hurry to get down levels, you don't really
have time to search out each level, so the best way to get enough
goodies to survive is to hope you're lucky and get a lot of shops.

Anyway, again after a few attempts I managed to ascend to demi-godhood
in a little under 3 hours, with NO CHEATING (I gave that up about a 
year ago) and with HARD OPTION on. It took 12,422 moves. I must admit
that my attempt was aided considerably by picking up a wand of wishing(2)
on about Dlvl 8.
So, can anyone beat that? Actually, I really have no idea whether that
is a hugely fast time or not, since I have no yardstick by which to
judge. Anyone else got a quick time to compare? I think that really I
was a bit conservative in my play, and could have got there quite a bit
quicker, but I wanted to make sure I could survive in battle against 
the Wiz and his nice pets.

